    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What a person sees (header `x-admin-token`)\n`GET /webhook/agent/approvals` - everything the agent asked permission for, with the customer, the order, the amount and the message that led to it.\n\n`POST /webhook/agent/approvals/decide` `{ approval_id, decision, decided_by }` - releases it. The money rules are checked **again** at this moment, because the order may have changed since the agent asked.\n\n`GET /webhook/agent/runs/trace?run_id=N` - the whole run, step by step: every model turn, every tool call, every refusal.\n\nIn production these back an inbox view in the support tool.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "45d7cd4f-23c6-4c73-a753-9288714cf7ad",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -320
      ]
    }
